  m_Name: Seraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.EnemyStats
  maxHealth: 12
  moveSpeed: 1.5
  scoreValue: 600
  contactDamage: 1
  description: A white-violet wheel that sings when it turns. The host does not know
    where the Seraphs came from either. They arrived; the host made room.
  tactics: Weaves while releasing a rotating TEN-bolt wheel (telegraphed, violet).
    Dense but slow - hug the rim of one gap and rotate with it. The weave makes its
    position drift, so re-anchor after every volley. Twelve HP; commit real fire
    to it.
